<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background: #f6f8fb;
            color: #1f2937;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 24px 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .header {
            padding: 28px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .brand {
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .title {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 32px;
        }
        .content p {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #374151;
        }
        .card {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            margin: 6px 0 14px;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 20px 32px 32px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #6b7280;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            background: #f9fafb;
        }
        .small {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container, .content, .header, .footer { padding: 24px; }
            .title { font-size: 22px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="brand"><%= appName || "Course Master" %></div>
                <div class="title">Welcome aboard, <%= firstName || "there" %>! 🎉</div>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
                <p>Hi <%= firstName || "there" %>,</p>
                <p>We're excited to have you join <strong><%= appName || "Course Master" %></strong>. Your account has been created and you're all set to start exploring courses, tracking progress, and earning certifications.</p>

                <div class="card">
                    <p><strong>Next steps:</strong></p>
                    <p>• Complete your profile so we can personalize recommendations.<br />
                       • Enroll in your first course and bookmark your roadmap.<br />
                       • Enable notifications to stay on top of new content and reminders.</p>
                </div>

                <% if (ctaUrl) { %>
                <a class="cta" href="<%= ctaUrl %>"><%= ctaLabel || "Get started" %></a>
                <% } %>

                <p>If you need any help, reply to this email or reach us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail || "support@example.com" %>"><%= supportEmail || "support@example.com" %></a>. We're here for you.</p>

                <p>Welcome again and happy learning!<br />
                — The <%= appName || "Course Master" %> Team</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <div><strong><%= appName || "Course Master" %></strong></div>
                <div class="small">If you didn't create this account, you can safely ignore this email.</div>
                <div class="small">© <%= year || new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= appName || "Course Master" %>. All rights reserved.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
